               <text>
                  <paragraph>anhydrous lactose, aspartame, dextrates, ferric oxide, glyceryl monostearate, lactose monohydrate, magnesium stearate, microcrystalline cellulose, natural peppermint flavor, polyacrylate dispersion, polysorbate 80, povidone, pregelatinized starch, sodium starch glycolate, talc</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20160203"/>
            </section>
         </component>
